# 1. Requirements for Instagram Signup Feature

I have selected the **Instagram Signup** feature because it is a common feature and has simple requirements to understand.

| Requirement ID | Requirement                                                                                                          |
| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **REQ-01**     | The user should be able to enter a valid mobile number or email address to create an account.                        |
| **REQ-02**     | The application should send an OTP/verification code to the registered mobile number or email.                       |
| **REQ-03**     | The user should be able to create a password that meets the required password rules.                                 |
| **REQ-04**     | The **Sign Up** button should allow registration only when all mandatory details are entered correctly.              |
| **REQ-05**     | After successful verification and registration, the user should be taken to their newly created account/home screen. |

