# 2. Requirement-to-Test Case Mapping

| Requirement ID | Requirement Description                                                    | Test Case ID | Test Case Description                                                                                           |
| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **REQ-01**     | User can enter a valid mobile number/email.                                | **TC-01**    | Enter a valid mobile number/email and check that it is accepted.                                                |
| **REQ-02**     | OTP should be sent for verification.                                       | **TC-02**    | Enter a valid mobile number and check whether the OTP is received.                                              |
| **REQ-03**     | Password should follow the required rules.                                 | **TC-03**    | Enter a password that satisfies all password requirements and verify that it is accepted.                       |
| **REQ-04**     | Signup should work only when mandatory details are valid.                  | **TC-04**    | Leave a mandatory field blank and check that signup is prevented with an appropriate message.                   |
| **REQ-05**     | Successful registration should take the user to their account/home screen. | **TC-05**    | Complete signup with valid details and verify that the account is created and the user reaches the home screen. |

